  "query_preview": "..\nA surge in moisture has moved over the region which can be attributed\nto Invest 90W, the monsoon trough, and a surface trough. Model\nguidance indicates showers to continue over the region with a heavier\nconcentration over Saipan and Tinian tonight and Tuesday, so the\nforecast zones were split to account for this spatial and slight \ncoverage difference from Rota and Guam. Then, depending on Invest \n90W's evolution (discussed in the Tropical Systems section below), a\ndry spell may occur over the region should 90W track northwest \ntoward the northern CNMI. The monsoon trough will follow, bringing \nincreasing showers and winds possibly this weekend.",
